      "title": "Lecturer, Design  - School Of Design & Environment",
      "description": "Closing Date: 15/11/2026 Find A Job | Careers@Gov Emphasized Available Values Footer actions skip to content Home Find A Job/ Internship FAQ CONTACT US LOGIN LOG OUT menu-button search-button LECTURER, DESIGN  - SCHOOL OF DESIGN & ENVIRONMENT Ngee Ann Polytechnic 03-05 year(s) Fixed Terms, Full-time Closing in 5  day(s) 0 Applicant(s) APPLY NOW What the role is This is a 11 month contract position as a Lecturer in the School of Design & Environment. What you will be working on Academic duties Develop and improve the content of modules you are assigned to teach and deliver for full-time and part-time learners Be competent to conduct teaching and delivery of modules in classroom and online setting Set and conduct assessments for the modules you are assigned Lead in the integration of modules content, teaching and delivery to achieve the course objectives Initiate and experiment with new pedagogies or learning technologies to enhance curriculum delivery Non- Academic duties To manage projects in School of Design & Environment’s ETC lab. To prepare project proposals for internal and external clients. To liaise with project stakeholders To do design-related work To do 3D printing and prototyping [optional] What we are looking for Candidate should have a minimum of 3 years of relevant working experience in the field of Product Design or Innovation. Prior teaching or training experience, with relevant pedagogical qualifications such as ACTA or ACLP will be an advantage A portfolio of past work for review About Ngee Ann Polytechnic At Ngee Ann Polytechnic, our nine academic schools offer over 40 full-time diplomas to a growing student population of more than 15,000. As a public tertiary institution, internationally-recognised for its academic excellence and close industry links, NP prides itself on having a dedicated and professional teaching faculty, complete with campus facilities that are among the finest in the world.\n\nAn institution of higher learning, Ngee Ann Polytechnic believes in giving every student an enriching learning experience and every employee the opportunity to build a meaningful career.\n\nIf you are a self-starter with an innovative mind, a versatile person with the drive for all-rounded excellence, and a dedicated team player who shares our vision and values, we invite you to join our inspired team. You might also be interested in ASSOCIATE LECTURER - STUDENT & YOUTH CARE SECTOR - HMIS Ngee Ann Polytechnic Closing in 5  day(s) LECTURER / SENIOR LECTURER – EMOTIONAL INTELLIGENCE & GLOBAL CITIZENSH Ngee Ann Polytechnic Closing in 1  day(s) SERVICE-LEARNING CATALYST, LECTURER - HMIS Ngee Ann Polytechnic Closing on 15 Nov 2026 LECTURER, CIVIL ENGINEERING - SCHOOL OF DESIGN & ENVIRONMENT Ngee Ann Polytechnic Closing on 15 Nov 2026 LECTURER - SCHOOL OF DESIGN & ENVIRONMENT Ngee Ann Polytechnic Closing on 08 Nov 2026 LECTURER, ENGINEERING SCIENCE - SCHOOL OF ENGINEERING Ngee Ann Polytechnic Closing on 08 Nov 2026 LECTURER, BIOMEDICAL ENGINEERING - SCHOOL OF ENGINEERING Ngee Ann Polytechnic Closing on 08 Nov 2026 School of Infocomm - Lecturer (Common Infocomm Programme) Republic Polytechnic Closing in 2  day(s) LECTURER, DESIGN  - SCHOOL OF DESIGN & ENVIRONMENT Ngee Ann Polytechnic Closing in 5  day(s) APPLY NOW"
